window.products.push({"id":983144,"name":"Shinlar Sunflower Gifts for Women-10 Pieces Best Friend Gifts'for Friends Female,BFF,Friendship Gifts Basket for Women Friends,Bestie,Sisters Birthday","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S0CXv9bSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEST FRIEND GIFTS FOR WOMEN - Are you looking for a special gift for friend or sister? This design contains positive emotional language to show your admiration, concern, and warmth. True friends are like bright sunflowers that never fade away, even over distance and time. Unique Sunflower gift box is a perfect gift idea for best friend, sister, bestie,and christian women friends. Surprise your best friend now! SUNFLOWER GIFTS BOX AT AMAZING PRICE - Our sunflower box contains 10 high-quality gifts: \"YOU'RE THE SISTER I GOT TO CHOOSE\" Wine tumbler, Friendship Jewelry Dish, Cute Cosmetic Mirror, Sunflower Bookmark, Sunflower Keychain, Yellow Fuzzy Socks, Makeup Bag, and A Greeting Card, all in a \"You are my sunshine\" exquisite gift box. SUNSHINE CARE PACKAGE GIFT IDEA - Did you know that sunflowers are often associated with friendship? The flower's resemblance to the sun is often seen as a symbol of the light of friendship. Sunflowers turn their faces towards the sun, just as a true friend always looks towards you with love, support, and encouragement. Let this gift keep nurturing your friendship, and appreciate the warmth it brings to your life. SUNFLOWER FRIEND GIFTS FOR ANY OCCASION - It's a warm sunflower gift that will make any occasion extra special. Whether it is used as best friend gifts for women, sister bestie gifts, sunflower gifts for sunflower lovers, sister gifts for religious christian women friends, or box of sunshine care package for women. It's a perfect friendship gifts on birthdays, anniversaries, Christmas, Valentine's Day, etc. MORE UNIQUE THAN A PINK GIFT BOX - Be the most special presence at her birthday party! No need for any extra outer packaging. 100% satisfaction guaranteed. We offer 180 days money back guarantee and replacement. Don't forget to select \"THIS ORDER CONTAINS A GIFT\" at check out and add a personalized gift message with your name.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S0CXv9bSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shinlar","source_asin":"B0BR5D64DP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-983144","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR5D64DP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR5D64DP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
