window.products.push({"id":983207,"name":"4-Sided Cheese Grater Stainless Steel with Strong Grip and Sharp Blades Professional Box Design with Perfect Slicer, Shredder & Zester For Fruits, Veg","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817Eqai297L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"4-sided stainless-steel box cheese grater features the ultra sharp blades and comfortable design with super strong grip  Our versatile four blade box cheese grater does the work of 4 separate handheld cheese graters, with fine grating, coarse grating, shredder and zester. It has the ribbon blade along with the popular slicer blade in one easy to use kitchen tool!  Best Overall Box Cheese Grater  Can easily shred a block of cheese with minimal effort GRATE & SLICE WITH EASE AND COMFORT: Whether you are grating cheese or slicing vegetables, our handheld box grater makes it easy. With sharp blades, manual food prep is a breeze. An all in one grater, slicer, shredder and zester. Made from stainless steel to a superior build quality. NO MORE SLIDING WHILE GRATING: An ergonomic design with a rubber base that keeps the grater firm and steady, making grating and chopping much less effort. Four sides make our grater a multi-purpose utensil. It grate all sorts of cheeses Including Parmesan, zest limes and lemons, slice garlic and ginger, and chop Veg with ease. SPEND LESS TIME CLEANING, MORE TIME COOKING: Easy to Clean and Dishwasher Safe. The rubber bottom removes easily, so you can deep clean the grater at any time. No lodged food bits. MAKE WORK EASY AND QUICK: It handles bigger projects where you need to shred a lot of vegetables or cheeses. Also use for recipes such as zucchini bread, where you need shredded zucchini and zest. Our box cheese graters is very versatile with multiple blades. One box cheese grater does the work of 4 individual handheld graters. ツ FOUR SIDED CHEESE GRATER | Details Material: Stainless Steel Material: Stainless Steel Comfortable, Non-slip Grip Comfortable, Non-slip Grip Dishwasher Safe Dishwasher Safe 4 Sides to Slice, Grate,Zest or Shred Foods 4 Sides to Slice, Grate,Zest or Shred Foods Great Gift for Newly-weds, And Housewarmings Great Gift for Newly-weds, And Housewarmings","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817Eqai297L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bstep","source_asin":"B08FRLWPQS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-983207","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FRLWPQS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FRLWPQS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
