window.products.push({"id":983225,"name":"Bed Pillows for Sleeping Queen Size 2 Pack, Plush Gel Down Alternative Pillow with 100% Breathable Cotton Cover for Back, Stomach Sleepers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xkFEaQEvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bed Pillows with Cotton Case】- Our luxury plush gel pillow is encased in a 100% organic sateen cotton cover with a glossy surface, feels soft and smooth on the skin. The breathable cotton pillow cover wicks moisture and lets you sleep cool, provides a comfortable sleep experience throughout the night. 【Perfect Balance Between Soft and Support】- The Bed Pillow is filled with super plush hollow fiber which allows air to circulate naturally inside, and provides you a fluffy and cloud-like feeling. It offers great support for head and neck so it can keep your head will never sink right down to the mattress, waking up with no more neck pain and headaches. 【Great for Back, Stomach Sleepers】- This fluffy pillow maintains the neck and head between the natural curve without causing pressure on the neck, helps to reduce neck pain and alleviate shoulder stiffness, ensures maximum comfort for any sleeping position. Ideal Pillow for stomach sleepers, also works well for back sleepers who prefer low firmness. 2 Pack Pillows in Vacuum-Sealed Package】- The pillows come with 2 packs in vacuum-sealed package. Take them out of the package, pat gently and air them for a few hours to make them fluffy; they will quickly return to their original full size. And the pillow is machine washable. Air dry in the sun or tumble dry on low temperature when need. Do not bleach or iron. 【Customer Service】- Our Bed Pillows are covered by 100% satisfaction policy. If you have any question about our Pillows, please feel free to email us at anytime. We will spare no effort to assist you to solve any problem!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xkFEaQEvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YOUMAKO","source_asin":"B081V7W4F4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-983225","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081V7W4F4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081V7W4F4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":983226,"name":"Inofia Twin Mattress Topper, 2.5-Inch Memory Foam Mattress Pad in Box, CertiPUR-US Certified Single Bed Topper with Cooling Breathable & Removable Ten","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816X57NEDbL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Memory foam 【RELAXING & COMFORT】 Our 2.5-inch memory foam mattress pad conforms to the natural curve of your body, supports your shoulders, back and hip, allowing your spine to stay in a neutral position, relaxing your muscles and reducing morning aches and pains, helping you enjoy a good sleep and to be energetic in a new day! 【PRESSURE RELIEF】 Whether you prefer to sleep on your belly, your back, or if you are a side sleeper, our foam mattress topper is for you.the cell structure design on our memory foam mattress pad expands to distribute your weight resulting in pressure point relief and increased comfort. Our foam bed topper adds the perfect mixture of medium softness and support to your existing mattress.It indeed will give your mattress a new life ！ 【UNIQUE 2-LAYER DESIGN】 Our mattress pad features a unique 2-Layer Design: 1st layer of 1” memory foam and 2nd layer of 1.5\" high density foam. The combination of two achieves the perfect balance of ADDITIONAL SOFTNESS & BETTER SUPPORT, allows it to be extremely comfortable while providing the correct spine alignment, relieves your pressure points & remains cool during your sleep, guarantees a PRESSURE-FREE and the BEST sleeping experience nights after nights. 【REMOVABLE & COOLING VENTILATED COVER】 60% polyester and 40% tencel made cover supplys you with breathable and cooling feeling, offers you skin friendly touch and extremly comfort during your sleep. Also Fully REMOVABLE and MACHINE WASHABLE for easy cleaning care. 【SHIPMENT & WARRANTY】rolled and packaged in a box for easy delivery and setup.please allow couple of days to allow it \"break in\" and fit your mattress perfectly. all the mattress topper from Inofia includes 100 nights free trial and 3 years warranty.please feel free to contact us if you you have any problems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816X57NEDbL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Inofia","source_asin":"B07KK7S8KR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-983226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KK7S8KR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KK7S8KR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
