window.products.push({"id":983278,"name":"Everleigh 105\" Reversible Sectional with Ottoman","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NgNL4WCYL._AC_.jpg","description":"AT A GLANCE 1. Overall Depth: 75 '' 2. Overall Height: 35 '' 3. Overall Width: 105 ''  Enjoy cozy family movie nights and host classy cocktail parties alike all at this stylish sectional sofa. The perfect centerpiece for your seating arrangement, it blends contemporary appeal with simple sophistication. The upholstery is accented with jumbo stitch detailing and tufted accent for a refined yet understated look. The sofa and the chaise can be separated, if you need to make more space in your living room ensemble. OVERALL DIMENSION 1. Overall: 35'' H x 105'' W x 75'' D PRODUCT DETAILS 1. Orientation: Reversible 2. Seat Fill Material: Foam 3. Upholstery Material: Linen Blend 4. Adult Assembly Required: Yes FEATURES 1. Modern and contemporary 2. Reversible sofa 3. Seating firmness: Medium 4. Very easy to assembly","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NgNL4WCYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Itsyou","source_asin":"B08C7FLP93","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-983278","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C7FLP93","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C7FLP93","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
