window.products.push({"id":983280,"name":"Enesco Jim Shore Disney Traditions Peter Pan Tinker Bell Sitting on Holly Figurine, 5 Inch, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.63,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FppeJjSYL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Disney Traditions collection by Jim Shore combines the magic of Disney with the time-honored motifs of hand-crafted folk art. Sitting atop a bushel of holly, Tinkerbell peers over Neverland with a caring Christmas eye. Watching over the Lost Boys, Tink enjoys a season spent with friends in this Jim Shore classic. About Us: Enesco is committed to BRING JOY EVERY DAY. The premier global destination for high-quality giftware, and home décor, our prestigious family of brands includes: Department 56 Village, Foundations, Jim Shore Heartwood Creek, Disney Traditions by Jim Shore, Disney Showcase Collection, Disney by Britto, Designs by Lolita, Our Name Is Mud, and many more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FppeJjSYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enesco","source_asin":"B09SSYZPJ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-983280","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SSYZPJ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SSYZPJ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":983281,"name":"16 Pack Food Storage Bag - Leakproof Reusable Containers for Snacks, Sandwich, Meat, Fruits, Vegetables, Extra Thick Vinyl Freezer Safe Bags","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dh2d3x+JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for a quick and easy way of storing your food? There are numerous ways you can store food. Some people use plastic boxes and canisters. Others prefer disposable plastic bags or glass jars. However, many of these options aren't exactly efficient. Boxes are large and take up a lot of space. Plastic bags can leak and make a mess in your fridge. Glass jars are pricey, and can be difficult to open. Preserve your snacks in the most practical way with the JinXiuQianCheng 16-Pack Food Storage Bag! Made for busy kitchens, our storage bag set includes 14 flat bags and 2 stand-up bags. Use the flat plastic bags to store your mini munchies like peanuts, biscuits, pretzels, and candies. For the stand-up bags, you can store bulky produce such as lemons, cucumbers, and apple slices. Or, use them to organize your cosmetics and toiletries. Never worry about spilled sauces or strong odors clinging to your fridge. These bags feature a leakproof double zippered top seal. The secure and tight closure makes them a great option for packing food for school, picnics, road trips, or camping. Store food in the freezer without the chill affecting their taste or texture. The waterproof bags use a tough and thick vinyl material, which helps prevent freezer burn while maintaining the freshness of your food. Plus, the bags do not contain BPA, making them safe to store and reuse. More reasons why you will love our plastic storage bags: - Free drying rack-no more dripping bags on your counters - Helps reduce plastic waste - Maximizes fridge space - Keeps food fresh for longer Switch to a more efficient and sustainable way of storing your food. Add JinXiuQianCheng 16-Pack Food Storage Bag to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dh2d3x+JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JinXiuQianCheng","source_asin":"B09NRM9BS2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-983281","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NRM9BS2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NRM9BS2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
