window.products.push({"id":983341,"name":"Zojirushi Ms. Bento Stainless-Steel Vacuum Lunch Jar, 28.5-Ounce, Stainless","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lgvdl39vL._AC_SL1255_.jpg","description":"Zojirushi Ms. Bento Stainless Vacuum Insulated Lunch Jar Lunch on the Go Whether in the office or on the go, you can take a healthier, tastier, more interesting lunch with you thanks to Zojirushi's Ms. Bento Stainless Lunch Jar. One of the most versatile lunch boxes you'll ever come across, the Ms. Bento lunch jar comes with three different containers that allow you to pack a multi-course lunch of both hot and cold items easily and securely. The jar itself is made of stainless steel and is vacuum-insulated that houses three plastic containers with lids. The large soup bowl comes with gasket-sealed lid to prevent messy spills and is specially insulated to keep soup hot. All pieces should be washed by hand with non-abrasive cleaning pads. Inner bowls are microwave-safe. The lunch jar lid also locks to hold all the inner containers. The Ms. Bento also comes with a convenient carry bag with a strap for easy transport. A forked spoon is included with its own protective cover. Capacity: Main Bowl 10oz, Side Bowl 11 oz, Soup Bowl 7 oz. Dimensions: Container measures 10 by 6 by 6 inches. Ms. Bento Features Vacuum insulation keeps foods hot or cold for hours Vacuum insulation keeps foods hot or cold for hours Durable stainless steel construction with excellent heat retention Durable stainless steel construction with excellent heat retention 3 microwaveable inner bowls 3 microwaveable inner bowls Washable nonstick coated outer container Washable nonstick coated outer container Includes forked spoon with cover and easy to carry tote bag Includes forked spoon with cover and easy to carry tote bag BPA Free BPA Free Great for Hot or Cold Lunches The Ms. Bento is an excellent way to safely and conveniently pack lunch where microwave or refrigerator may not be available. The Ms. Bento allows you to compartmentalize your food and bring an entire meal, like a pasta dish, soup, salad and cookies in each separate bowl. You will appreciate the “greenness” of packing a lunch in our lunch jars, instead of using a paper bag or disposable containers. How does it keep food hot or cold? With Zojirushi's renowned vacuum insulation technology, air between the two thin layers of stainless steel on the outer container is removed, creating a vacuum. Because there is no air, the temperature on the outside does not transfer into the container; keeping foods hot or cold for hours. What's in the Box Side Bowl The Ms. Bento comes with an 11-ounce side bowl that sits inside the lid. It is ideal for foods that should be kept room temperature, such as chips, nuts or snacks. The side bowl is not insulated. Main Bowl The 10-ounce main bowl is designed to hold the main course. The outer container's vacuum insulation and the insulated lid of the main bowl help keep foods hot or cold for hours without reheating or refrigeration. Soup Bowl The 7-ounce soup bowl has a unique lid that minimizes leaks and is ideal for holding soups, dips, or fruit cocktail. It sits at the bottom of the outer container, where vacuum insulation keeps the foods hot or cold for hours. Forked Spoon Never worry about forgetting your utensils. The Ms. Bento also includes a forked spoon with its own protective cover.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lgvdl39vL._AC_SL1255_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zojirushi","source_asin":"B07CK8VVMP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-983341","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CK8VVMP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CK8VVMP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
