window.products.push({"id":983571,"name":"5 Litres Pure Copper Alembic Still for whiskey, moonshine, essential oils by Copperholic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rzxQR5zZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make Your Drinks Like Our Ancestors Did With Copper Alembic Still! Our handcrafted stills are used to create both alcohol and essential oils. The Copperholic alembic still is equipped with a copper pot, soldered union construction, a swan neck lid and a condensing recipient with serpentine coil. Enjoy producing your favorite drinks all naturally in our hammered copper pot. It is the best and easiest way to make drinks on your own. You can make your drinks anywhere! Perfect for use outdoors or indoors. Features of Copper Alembic Still Made of pure copper & brass. Capacity: 5 Litres Weight: 06 lbs 20 gauge used for belly and onion top as well as the condenser. Since it is not machine made and is handcrafted by skilled artisans there maybe a slight difference in the capacity and size. Care Instructions for a Long Lasting Copper Alembic Moonshine Still After each use, clean with warm water and soft soap. Dry the copper still with soft cloth. Do not leave liquid in the belly when not in use to avoid stains. Not dishwasher safe. Do not use in microwave.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rzxQR5zZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COPPERHOLIC","source_asin":"B091RWSBGH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-983571","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091RWSBGH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091RWSBGH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
