window.products.push({"id":983771,"name":"TRAVEL ESSENTIALS UTENSILS SET BLUE 9 Pieces| Reusable Portable Flatware | Knife Fork Spoon Chopsticks Cleaning Brush Straw Case | Stainless Steel Fla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810VwCOPdWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Life At Home US Portable Cutlery Set This portable & reusable travel utensil set includes everything you need for a meal for one: A knife, a fork, a spoon, chopsticks, a regular straw, a bobo straw and a handy-dandy straw brush (to clean the straw). The silicon straw tips make it more comfortable to drink and protect your lips from the hot liquid. With a smooth finish and ergonomic shape, the black stainless steel flatware is dishwasher safe and durable enough for daily use. The utensils come packaged in a hard, black zippered case. The padded travel case protects the cutlery, so they don’t bump or scratch. (And there’ll be no noise of the cutlery banging around during travel.) Each case can be wiped clean and the inside is waterproof. An added loop makes this portable cutlery easy to hang and find. Store this lightweight dinnerware set with case in your car, office or luggage. It’s compact enough to take along on picnics, business and camping trips. The utensils are full-sized, so use ‘em in college dorm rooms, in hotels and when dining out in restaurants. Do your part in protecting our environment. Use reusable cutlery. It’s hygienic and eco-friendly. (And you won’t need to worry about loads of plastic ending up in landfills. ) Our portable cutlery sets have been used in hotels, offices, restaurants and camping trips worldwide. Solopreneurs love the modern feel and sleek finish of our travel utensils set with case. (Our 100% satisfaction guarantee is an added bonus). Click ‘add-to-cart’ now and become a proud owner of our portable cutlery. Because with LAH KITCHEN, you know you’re getting quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810VwCOPdWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAH KITCHEN","source_asin":"B0BF7FXNLK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-983771","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF7FXNLK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF7FXNLK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":983772,"name":"Thundercloud Plum Tree - 3-4 ft.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Bb75lnVIL._AC_.jpg","description":"You can break up the monochromatic look of your green landscape by planting a single Thundercloud Plum tree (Prunus cerasifera â€˜Thundercloudâ€). It throws a riot of color into the entire growing season, beginning in early spring and ending in autumn. After its colorful transition from pinkish-white flowers to red leaves to purple foliage, it flashes another shade of red with its tiny fruits while retaining its rich purple foliage through fall!A Flurry of Flowers and Vibrant FoliageThundercloud Plum doesnâ€t bear typical plum fruits; in fact, itâ€s classified as an â€œornamentalâ€ plum tree. Itâ€s also known as purple-leaf plum because of its foliage color and cherry plum because of the red cherry-sized fruits that appear on many trees. No matter what you call it, Thundercloud Plum will be a vibrant addition to your landscape design because of its:- Showy, fragrant flowers. Plum trees bloom in early spring before their leaves appear. Thundercloudâ€s flowers may remind you of the peaceful calm before the storm of emerging leaves begins to open. Delicate pinkish-white blooms profusely cover these trees to usher in springtime with an eye-popping display.- Transitioning leaf color. As the new leaves emerge in springtime, they are a vivid shade of ruby-red. As they mature, the color deepens to a rich purple.- Striking appearance as a specimen plant. In the landscape-design world, a â€œspecimen plantâ€ is one that you plant as a focal point, which stands out among other landscape features. This type of plant draws the eye toward it â€“ itâ€s a showpiece among other plants in the landscape. Thundercloud Plum is a true showpiece!Richly Modest Purple Leaves Until AutumnPurple has long been associated with royalty, and Thundercloud Plum treeâ€s lavishly colored foliage is indeed regal-looking. This is a tree that will not overpower your landscape, particularly if you have a small yard. Its mature height, which reaches approximately 20 f","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Bb75lnVIL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brighter Blooms","source_asin":"B079XCTD91","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-983772","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079XCTD91","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079XCTD91","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":983773,"name":"Exceptionlab ILOVENY 10-Ounce Ceramic Cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31S5i-CT61L._AC_.jpg","description":"The world-famous logo, on a ceramic cup that looks like it's made of paper. With this ceramic version of the iloveny paper cup, Graham Hill, joins others in a recent trend of rendering disposables into permanent, useful objects. These practical souvenir cups look like they are made of paper and portrait one of most famous logos of all times: The iloveny logo, which is the result of the successful effort to \"brand\" the state of New York during the final moments of the state's fiscal crisis in the 1970's. They hold 10-Ounce of liquid. They can be heated in the microwave, washed in the dishwasher and are certified to be lead-free. The design of the rim, coupled with a hollow base allows one to comfortably drink a hot beverage without requiring a bulky handle. Licensed by NYSDED, they come in individual gift boxes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31S5i-CT61L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ExceptionLab","source_asin":"B004HHNR5W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-983773","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004HHNR5W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004HHNR5W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
