window.products.push({"id":983944,"name":"KEOUKE Mini Manual Food Processor Portable Garlic Chopper Grinder Pull String Vegetable Chopper for Veggies, Fruits, Garlic, Onion, Ginger, Nuts, etc ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419OOeDRntL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"MINI GARLIC CHOPPER - 🧄This vegetable chopper is available in 0.7-cup and 1-cup capacity versions, the sizes are 3.5\"*2.8\" (D*H) and 3.96\"*3.3\" (D*H). This mini food chopper is smaller than other brands, which is easier to carry. Do not require electricity and complicated operating skills, best for travel, camping, barbecuing, etc. UNIQUE MAGNETIC BLADE - 🧄KEOUKE mini food processor uses the unique magnetic blade installation method on the market, and the blade will be absorbed in the upper cover. This design can reduce the time of touching the blades, and the blade will not stay in the container after cutting. At the same time, the magnetic blade makes the work more stable and quiet. SAVE YOUR TIME - 🧄Two blades of the vegetable chopper are distributed at different heights and directions to achieve even and fast food chopping. Cooking prep is done with a few simple pulls of the cord. 1-5 times for coarse chopping, 6-10 for medium, 11-20 for fine, and 20+ for super fine and liquid purees. It can handle various foods such as garlic, onion, pepper, carrot, tomato, ginger, etc. EASY TO USE - 🧄First, carefully insert the blade into the protrusion of the lid, the blade will be magnetically absorbed to the lid. Secondly, cut the food into suitable large pieces and put them in the lid. Put the transparent bowl on the lid and rotate it tightly. Finally, put the food chopper upright and pull the rope several times horizontally. The drawstring is made of high-strength nylon rope and has an anti-stuck design to ensure smooth use. SAFE MATERIAL - 🧄The lid of the mini food processor is made of PP material and the bowl is made of AS, which is sturdy and durable. The blades are made of 420 stainless steel to ensure they will not bend or rust. Anti-slip rubber is added to the bottom to ensure more stable use. All parts are food-grade and safe for the dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419OOeDRntL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KEOUKE","source_asin":"B0C42XMPRV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-983944","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C42XMPRV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C42XMPRV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
