window.products.push({"id":983954,"name":"Stainless Steel Drinking Straws by Simply Delicioso, Set of 4 + Straw Cleaning Brush, Strong Reusable Recyclable Eco Friendly Metal Drinking Straws","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wnTOwaLnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Stainless Steel Straws : Plastic-Free, Waste-Free And Designed To Last A Lifetime Simply Delicioso has released its elegant range of eco-friendly Stainless Steel Drinking Straws that are reusable, non-toxic and guaranteed to last a lifetime. Made from polished 18/8 stainless steel, they are a stylish addition to cold summer beverages, backyard BBQ drinks and dinner party cocktails. Plus, being dishwasher safe and highly durable, they are an easy item to pop in a bag or picnic set for reusing when out and about. Plastic straws are single use items that are filling up our landfills by the billions. McDonalds alone sells an estimated 64 million meals DAILY Just think about how many of those sales might include a drink with a plastic straw!! Each and every one of those unrecyclable straws is destined for landfill. Making the switch to stainless steel is a practical way to reduce consumption of this common throw away item. Equally important, Simply Delicioso's stainless steel straws are free of the unhealthy toxins present in plastic straws, such BPA, that can lead to serious adverse health issues.Both environmentally and budget-friendly, Simply Delicioso's Stainless Steel Straws are made from polished 18/8 stainless steel. They are dishwasher safe as well as being BPA, PVC and Phthalate Free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wnTOwaLnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simply Delicioso","source_asin":"B01B11CEW8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-983954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01B11CEW8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01B11CEW8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
