window.products.push({"id":983993,"name":"MIULEE Pack of 2 Ultra Soft Fluffy Throw Pillow Covers Decorative Plush Shaggy Double-Sided Faux Fur Pillow Cases Cushions Covers for Sofa Bedroom Car","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GbZGPSdYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Polyester Product Dimension: Package includes two pieces of 18x18 inch pillow covers. Fillers or inserts are NOT INCLUDED. Soft Touch: Both sides are made of high quality mongolian faux fur with shaggy and furry touch. It's friendly for kids and pets.Color may be different in different light or on different screen. Exquisite Design: The color is designed to be ombre, showing subtle and classy. The hidden zipper makes the pillow cover more neat. Please take a little time to carefully zip them up so the fabric don’t get caught. Attractive Decoration: Perfect compliments to the sofa, chair and couch. Easily brighten up your home with blended color. Especially the double-sided fur lends a silky feeling to your skin, while adding a little glam to your living space. Easy Care: Hand Wash or Machine Wash Cold Separately. Gently Cycle Only. Dot Not Bleach. Tumble Dry. Do Not Iron and it'll look brand new.MIULEE,TOUCH YOUR LIFE.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GbZGPSdYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIULEE","source_asin":"B0859SPLBG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-983993","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0859SPLBG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0859SPLBG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":983994,"name":"Queen Comforter Set 7 Piece Ultra Soft Fashion Printed Bedding Sets with Shams, Decorative Throw Pillows, and Pillowcases, Queen, Margolis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.76,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cslDgW-nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing our luxurious 7-Piece Printed Comforter Set, designed to transform your bedroom into a haven of comfort and style. This exquisite ensemble includes 1 Down Alternative Comforter, 2 Square Euro Shams, 2 Pillow Shams, and 2 Decorative Throw Pillows, providing you with everything you need for a complete bedding makeover. At the heart of this set is our premium Down Alternative Comforter. Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, it offers the perfect balance of warmth and breathability for a comfortable night's sleep. The generous poly fill ensures a restful sleep environment. The 2 Square Euro Shams included in this set add a touch of elegance to your bedroom decor. With their stylish design and soft fabric, they provide the perfect backdrop for your pillows, creating a cohesive and sophisticated look. Enhance the overall aesthetic with the 2 Pillow Shams that beautifully complement the comforter and Euro shams. These shams feature a tailored design and high-quality construction, adding a refined finishing touch to your bed ensemble. To complete the ensemble, we've included 2 Decorative Throw Pillows that serve as eye-catching accents. These pillows feature intricate patterns and textures, adding a pop of personality to your bedroom decor. Place them strategically to create an inviting and cozy ambiance. Crafted with the utmost care, this 7-Piece Printed Comforter Set is made from premium materials that ensure durability and long-lasting performance. The soft fabric is gentle against your skin, providing a comfortable and indulgent sleeping experience. The set is available in a range of beautiful prints and colors, allowing you to choose the perfect style to complement your existing bedroom decor or create a fresh new look. Whether you prefer vibrant and bold patterns or subtle and sophisticated designs, we have a variety of options to suit your taste. In addition to its aesthetic appeal, this comforter set is designed for convenience. The entire set is machine washable, making maintenance a breeze. Simply toss it in the washing machine and enjoy the ease of keeping your bedding fresh and clean. Upgrade your bedroom with our 7-Piece Printed Comforter Set, where luxury meets functionality. Experience the comfort of our Down Alternative Comforter, elevate your decor with the Euro and Pillow Shams, and add the perfect finishing touch with the Decorative Throw Pillows. Embrace style, comfort, and quality in one complete package. Create your own personal oasis of relaxation and beauty with this exquisite comforter set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cslDgW-nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sweet Home Collection","source_asin":"B0BX9JD22H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-983994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX9JD22H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX9JD22H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
